<LanguageData>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Label>Tracking laser</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Description>Select a unit. After charging for one second, fire a focused laser that continuously tracks the target. Consumes 0.5% of maximum energy per second and lasts up to ten seconds per firing cycle.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Label>Sweeping laser</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Description>Select two visible locations in sequence. After charging for one second, fire a sweeping laser that consumes 0.5% of maximum energy per second.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopTracking.Label>Stop tracking laser</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopTracking.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopSweep.Label>Stop sweeping laser</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopSweep.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Stop.Description>Stop firing the laser.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Stop.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NotDrafted>Only available while drafted.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NotDrafted>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Emergency>Cannot fire during emergency landing.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Emergency>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Cooldown>Laser system cooling down: {0} seconds.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Cooldown>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NoEnergy>Insufficient energy for the next pulse.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NoEnergy>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Busy>The other laser is firing.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Busy>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Unavailable>This Chariot cannot fire its lasers right now.</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Unavailable>
